# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#  pulse-echo-cof-sim
#
#  The rule that matters here: large binary artefacts must never enter
#  git history. Once committed they are permanent even if deleted in a
#  later commit, and GitHub hard-rejects any single file over 100 MB.
#
#  As of the baseline commit, sim/ holds roughly 1.2 GB of finite-element
#  mesh and trace .npz files written next to the source, six of which are
#  individually over the limit. out/ holds the simulated trace archive,
#  which is deposited to a data repository rather than versioned.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/

# --- Environments ----------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
.python-version

# --- Solver artefacts written beside the source ----------------------
#  Finite-element meshes and solver dumps. Regenerable, and the largest
#  are 284, 241, 241 and 195 MB. Note this rule is anchored to sim/ only,
#  so the small reference data in sim/ref/ is still tracked.
/sim/*.npz
/sim/*.npy

#  Exception: the five finite-element cross-check trace archives are
#  63 kB each and are the only raw evidence behind Appendix A's
#  -19.5 -> -46.2 dB sequence and the 2.9 dB agreement. Without them the
#  appendix cannot be checked without rebuilding a 284 MB mesh.
!/sim/fe_p2plus_ab*_traces.npz

# --- Simulated trace archive -----------------------------------------
#  About 60 MB across the sweep directories and growing with every run.
#  Deposited alongside the paper, not versioned.
/out/

# --- Generated figures -----------------------------------------------
/figures/*.png
/figures/*.pdf
/figures/*.svg
/figures/*.eps

# --- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------
.streamlit/secrets.toml
*.pem
*.key

# --- Editor and OS ---------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
